WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.360
What's up everybody!

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.480
We are Pongfinity

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.900
It's time for the first challenge episode of 2020

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:12.720
Let's go!

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.180
Okay that's the first one

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.580
So the next challenge is to

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.980
play with a polaroid picture of yourself

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:35.260
Emil, say cheese!

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.460
Okay I think the polaroid pictures are ready

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:51.100
So I'll be playing with this

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:53.720
This looks even more crazy!

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.540
These are from a horror film these pictures

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.080
If there would be a picture of Ma Long

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:09.220
you would get all the forehands on table

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:10.880
But luckily we have a picture of Otto

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:13.980
so soon it's gonna be mayhem time

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:28.680
That would have been good!

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:38.440
Who is gonna miss: Miikka or Emil?

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:39.860
Emil!

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:46.600
Otto how does it feel that i'm playing with you?

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:49.460
It just hurts to see how bad you play

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:54.460
These are probaly the worst pictures of us ever taken!

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:57.920
30 chops in 40 seconds, let's see if we can do it!

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:51.920
Lets tape these two rackets together

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:56.520
How are you supposed to play with this?

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:14.380
This feels a bit like tennis

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:44.440
I just hope the racket is not gonna come off

00:03:58.740 --> 00:04:00.620
That would have been too good to be true!

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.780
It's actually good because you have better reach with this one

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.780
You don't have to move so much

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:11.900
And I like that!

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:31.240
Well it didn't hit the rubber but still a good shot

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.260
Remember to subsribe to our channel here

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:35.100
and watch our previous videos there!

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:36.220
Until next time!

